{
  "id": 282,
  "title": "古河云科技校园数字孪生解决方案",
  "date": "2023-08-31",
  "summary": "智慧校园基于数字孪生的三维虚拟化技术，以数字化、可视化、智能化理念为目标，借助物联网、大数据、人工智能等先进手段，通过直观、动态的形式呈现校园各类建筑、能源、教育、教学、后勤、安全等设备的空间分布、运行状况和统计数据。",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-282.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2023-8-31/20238311016145359.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<div class=\"show-monitor\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><div class=\"expand-container\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;max-height:none;\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;position:static;\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><div class=\"article-content\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;\"><article class=\"syl-article-base tt-article-content syl-page-article syl-device-pc\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px;text-align:justify;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word;overflow:hidden;hyphens:auto;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.667;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><p data-track=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">智慧校园需将环境信息、资源信息和应用信息全部转化为数字化信息，为管理决策和服务提供强有力的支持。智慧系统集智能化感知、智能化控制、智能化管理、智能化互动反馈、智能化数据分析、智能化视窗等功能于一体，旨在实现校园信息服务的全面提升。</span></span></p><p data-track=\"2\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\">行业现状及痛点分析</span></span></p><p data-track=\"4\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\">信息化建设孤岛化</span></span></p><p data-track=\"5\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">校园管理、教学、后勤和安全等系统缺乏统一规划，导致各部门或各系统之间各自为政，数据无法有效共享。数据融合和管理服务深度结合不足，无法进行联动分析和统一管理。</span></span></p><p data-track=\"6\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\">缺少智慧大脑</span></span></p><p data-track=\"7\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">校园信息化建设面临着数据汇集的挑战，无法从顶层设计、运营维护角度提供精准、高效的可视化、智能化、自动化的支持保障。</span></span></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:18px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\"><img src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-qvj2lq49k0/668afda53a1046e1aa01c221dbd544b8~tplv-tt-origin-asy2:5aS05p2hQOWPpOays-S6keenkeaKgA==.image?_iz=58558&amp;from=article.pc_detail&amp;x-expires=1694052874&amp;x-signature=kmZeGfbFyd8z0mIu%2Fkn3vLlabJk%3D\" img_width=\"1080\" img_height=\"627\" image_type=\"1\" mime_type=\"image/jpeg\" web_uri=\"tos-cn-i-qvj2lq49k0/668afda53a1046e1aa01c221dbd544b8\" class=\"syl-page-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;margin:0px auto 8px;padding:0px;cursor:zoom-in;max-width:100%;display:block;border-radius:4px;height:auto;\" /><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:0px !important;\"><br /></p></div><p data-track=\"8\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\">智慧化服务不足</span></span></p><p data-track=\"9\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">设施和空间的设计没有考虑到学生的实际需求，无法提供主动服务。校园未能实现可视化管理和智能化联动，导致校园资源无法满足用户的需求，用户体验十分差。</span></span></p><p data-track=\"10\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\">运营能力不足</span></span></p><p data-track=\"11\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">日常管理缺乏精细度，大量依赖人工操作，导致人力资源严重浪费。对于持续运营的重视不足，虽然建设了大量系统，但没有收集和整合各个系统的数据，因此大量投入的建设成本并未带来运营效率的显著提升。</span></span></p><p data-track=\"12\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\">缺乏协调机制</span></span></p><p data-track=\"13\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">学校的教学、后勤等各个业务部门和管理系统之间形成了“部门墙”和“工具墙”，导致总体管理变得复杂，应急指挥和解决问题的流程繁琐，协调成本高昂。</span></span></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:18px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\"><img src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-qvj2lq49k0/ba874f6643684038b1ccc77c5e73efeb~tplv-tt-origin-asy2:5aS05p2hQOWPpOays-S6keenkeaKgA==.image?_iz=58558&amp;from=article.pc_detail&amp;x-expires=1694052874&amp;x-signature=%2BDQS6ayt%2F%2BG%2FEL8ZHybPSMlJ4rA%3D\" img_width=\"1080\" img_height=\"587\" image_type=\"1\" mime_type=\"image/png\" web_uri=\"tos-cn-i-qvj2lq49k0/ba874f6643684038b1ccc77c5e73efeb\" class=\"syl-page-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;margin:0px auto 8px;padding:0px;cursor:zoom-in;max-width:100%;display:block;border-radius:4px;height:auto;\" /><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:0px !important;\"><br /></p></div><p data-track=\"14\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\">新技术驱动</span></span></p><p data-track=\"15\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">云计算、大数据、物联网（IoT）、5G、可视化、数字孪生和AI等先进技术的广泛应用，不仅增加了管理对象的种类和数量，还极大地提高了管理的复杂度。因此，我们需要寻找新的管理方式来应对这些挑战。</span></span></p><p data-track=\"16\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\">场景化管理不足</span></span></p><p data-track=\"17\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">智慧校园的构建已不再是单一解决某个特定场景的问题。我们的目标是打造真正轻便、易用、一站式贯穿所有校园管理场景的解决方案，从而显著提升智慧校园的建设和运行水平。</span></span></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:18px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\"><img src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-qvj2lq49k0/769b9b4d37184aa68a4982c40b66de86~tplv-tt-origin-asy2:5aS05p2hQOWPpOays-S6keenkeaKgA==.image?_iz=58558&amp;from=article.pc_detail&amp;x-expires=1694052874&amp;x-signature=M3ZT65f3ACEIAUqYluGjNRpBb88%3D\" img_width=\"1080\" img_height=\"587\" image_type=\"1\" mime_type=\"image/png\" web_uri=\"tos-cn-i-qvj2lq49k0/769b9b4d37184aa68a4982c40b66de86\" class=\"syl-page-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;margin:0px auto 8px;padding:0px;cursor:zoom-in;max-width:100%;display:block;border-radius:4px;height:auto;\" /><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:0px !important;\"><br /></p></div><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:18px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\"><img src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-qvj2lq49k0/6455593f720e426fbd156a53c0c2d25a~tplv-tt-origin-asy2:5aS05p2hQOWPpOays-S6keenkeaKgA==.image?_iz=58558&amp;from=article.pc_detail&amp;x-expires=1694052874&amp;x-signature=YRNH4TanFQjZA5xBPO%2FWaC1lsXs%3D\" img_width=\"750\" img_height=\"56\" image_type=\"1\" mime_type=\"image/jpeg\" web_uri=\"tos-cn-i-qvj2lq49k0/6455593f720e426fbd156a53c0c2d25a\" class=\"syl-page-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;margin:0px auto 8px;padding:0px;cursor:zoom-in;max-width:100%;display:block;border-radius:4px;height:auto;\" /><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:0px !important;\"><br /></p></div><p data-track=\"18\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\">智慧校园解决方案</span></span></p><p data-track=\"20\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">通过\"开河\"平台，我们将实现学校各系统的完美融合，打造集领导驾驶舱、平安校园、智能安防、智能消防、网络安全、数字后勤、能源管理、资产管理、智能设施管理、智慧学研、智慧教室、应急预案于一体的智慧校园系统。同时，打造智能机房和智能数据中心，轻松实现校园智能化管理。</span></span></p><p data-track=\"21\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\">领导驾驶舱</span></span></p><p data-track=\"22\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">瞬间定位校园内楼宇、学院和行政单位的所在地，并获取丰富的校园信息。静态信息与三维场景完美融合，生动呈现校园布局。此外，还提供建筑信息、能耗、网络等多维度信息集成，宏观数据一目了然。信息中心、后勤等部门也能统一管理多校区的网络、交通等资源。结合地图信息及三维场景，实现多校区网络、交通的互联互通，打造便捷的校园生活。</span></span></p><p data-track=\"23\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\">安防、消防态势感知</span></span></p><p data-track=\"24\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">面向保卫处及物业运营人员，实现园区视频监控、消防、人脸识别设备的智能化管理。设备统一运维，结合三维场景实现精准定位，提升基础设施运维效率；多场景监控；安消联动，事件应急联动指挥。实现园区消防栓、消防通道、消防登高区等消防资源的可视化管理。结合安防资源信息与告警数据，辅助判断消防告警的准确性。</span></span></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:18px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\"><img src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-qvj2lq49k0/04ffa5d3e4a546ceb4df31900494f8d7~tplv-tt-origin-asy2:5aS05p2hQOWPpOays-S6keenkeaKgA==.image?_iz=58558&amp;from=article.pc_detail&amp;x-expires=1694052874&amp;x-signature=sUk2x3g5YF%2F2CFFKUbAsTknnuu8%3D\" img_width=\"1080\" img_height=\"587\" image_type=\"1\" mime_type=\"image/png\" web_uri=\"tos-cn-i-qvj2lq49k0/04ffa5d3e4a546ceb4df31900494f8d7\" class=\"syl-page-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;margin:0px auto 8px;padding:0px;cursor:zoom-in;max-width:100%;display:block;border-radius:4px;height:auto;\" /><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:0px !important;\"><br /></p></div><p data-track=\"25\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\">数据中心</span></span></p><p data-track=\"26\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;